WEBVTT

00:06:58.982 --> 00:07:01.551
but the helpful woman
will not be recognized

00:07:01.584 --> 00:07:04.554
as having what it takes
to be a successful leader.

00:07:04.587 --> 00:07:09.192
Last week I was quoting my speaker fee
to a potential client,

00:07:09.192 --> 00:07:11.928
and when I told him the price,
he said to me,

00:07:11.962 --> 00:07:14.664
"Wow. Good for you. That's a lot.

00:07:14.698 --> 00:07:18.401
Isn't documentary filmmaking
kind of, like, your hobby?"

00:07:19.135 --> 00:07:20.370
(Laughter)

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.105
Ouch.

00:07:24.174 --> 00:07:27.978
As humans, we're limited
to what we can do to mitigate our biases.

00:07:28.011 --> 00:07:31.348
So even if we were able to,
say, implement a tool